# --- Third-party / institutional documents -----------------------------------
# This repository is public, so neither the IACB preprint (Fleetwood et al.,
# SSRN 3777231) nor the UEA assessment brief is redistributed here. See
# NHANES_dissertation/reference/README.md for where to obtain the preprint if
# you want to re-run 08_extract_iacb.py; data/scales/iacb_scores.csv is supplied.
NHANES_dissertation/reference/ssrn-*.pdf
NHANES_dissertation/reference/*Assessment*Brief*.docx

